// EXPECT: [E011]
// EXPECT-TEXT: Error Ln 9, Col 8: this call closes a mutual-recursion cycle
// The front end's own cycle walker (sema.h, `mrec_*`) is deleted: mutual recursion is the IR engine's
// obligation (analysis/report.h), and the walker had been reached by nothing since. Before deleting
// it, the shapes it searched expression trees for were written out; the engine refuses each,
// at the call that closes the cycle. Its DFS also stopped silently at 256 functions.
// Here the closing call is in an `if` CONDITION: f -> p -> f.
func f(n u32) u32 {
    if p(n) { return 1 }
    return 0
}
func p(n u32) bool {
    return f(n) == 1
}
func main() i32 {
    return f(3) as i32
}
